1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,400
China grows more wheat than any country on Earth.
{\fs13}I'm your China Travel Expert

2
00:00:02,400 --> 00:00:05,000
About 140 million tonnes a year — plus 207 million tonnes of rice.

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:07,600
Both rank world number one. So what's the real Chinese staple?

4
00:00:07,600 --> 00:00:09,800
The north runs on wheat — noodles, buns, dumplings.

5
00:00:09,800 --> 00:00:12,000
The south runs on rice. One country, two tables.

6
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:14,000
Double-tap if you'd pick the noodle bowl.

7
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:16,000
★ Expert Tip: cross the Qinling–Huaihe line and the staple flips.

8
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:18,400
Noodles or rice — which is the TRUE Chinese staple? Tell me below.
